<title>JAPAN: Japan 1996/97 aluminium output, shipments rise.</title>
<headline>Japan 1996/97 aluminium output, shipments rise.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese output and shipments of fabricated aluminium products hit record highs in the 1996/97 year, compared with the previous year, the Japan Aluminum Federation said on Friday.</p>
<p>The 1996/97 data was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		     1996/97     yr/yr change</p>
<p> Output	  2,532,894     +5.4 pct</p>
<p>   Flat-rolled 1,254,822     +2.6 pct</p>
<p>   Extrusions  1,278,072     +8.2 pct</p>
<p> Shipments     2,528,632     +5.9 pct</p>
<p>   Flat-rolled 1,250,878     +3.1 pct</p>
<p>   Extrusions  1,277,754     +8.7 pct</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
